test('non-OPEN min-only 전달은 누락·오염을 native0으로 닫고 더 늦은 값으로 원 기한을 늘리지 않는다',async()=>{
 for(const mode of ['MISSING','NAN','INFINITY','FRACTION','LATER','SHORT']){const f=await phaseHttpFixture('STATE');try{const actual=f.source.signPhase;let late:((at:number)=>void)|undefined;const source={signPhase:async(c:any,p:any,b:any,signal:any,narrow:any)=>{late=narrow;if(mode==='MISSING')return actual(c,p,b,signal);if(mode==='LATER')f.state.currentUntil+=30000;if(mode==='SHORT')f.state.currentUntil-=7000;if(mode==='NAN')f.state.currentUntil=NaN;if(mode==='INFINITY')f.state.currentUntil=Infinity;if(mode==='FRACTION')f.state.currentUntil+=0.5;return actual(c,p,b,signal,narrow);}},work=f.client.consumeReceivePhase(f.input.window,f.input.challenge,f.input.request,f.input.body,source);if(mode==='LATER'||mode==='SHORT'){await work;assert.equal(f.state.deadline,Date.parse(at)+(mode==='SHORT'?3000:10000));assert.equal(f.state.native,2);assert.throws(()=>late!(Date.parse(at)+60000));assert.equal(f.state.native,2);}else{await assert.rejects(work);assert.equal(f.state.native,1,mode);assert.equal(f.state.signs,mode==='MISSING'?1:0,mode);}}finally{f.client.disposeReceive();}}
});
